    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever of 38.0 °C or more, chills, or rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore throat and runny nose; no ear pain or mouth sores</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry cough; no shortness of breath or chest pain</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vomiting or diarrhea; nausea settled</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No burning or frequency</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Wound healed; no redness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

